BT 1 0 0 1 0 35 Tm /F1 10 Tf 15 TL (Average time: Theta\(n log n\); worst case: Theta\(n^2\), for example on already sorted input when the last element) Tj T* -0.092222 Tw (is always chosen as pivot. Usually unstable; recursion stack is Theta\(log n\) on average and Theta\(n\) in the worst) Tj T* 0 Tw (case.) Tj T* ET
